# Route: guide 20 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 41 to 43, 34
# quests, 2.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Arathi Highlands): Circle of West Binding -> Thandol Span -> Faldir's
# Cove -> Thandol Span -> Refuge Pointe -> Boulder'gor -> Northfold Manor ->
# Boulder'gor -> Refuge Pointe -> Go'Shek Farm -> Circle of Outer Binding ->
# Go'Shek Farm -> Circle of East Binding -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Wanted!  Marez Cowl (684; Marez
# Cowl 40); Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest (685; Otto 38, Lord Falconcrest 40);
# Stromgarde Badges (682; Syndicate Prowler 36-37, Syndicate Conjuror 35-36,
# Syndicate Magus 37-38); Breaking the Keystone (652; Fozruk 42); Trelane's
# Defenses (694; Boulderfist Shaman 38-39).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

